{"headword":"מַעְיָן²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.24\">Pr 8:24</a> <strong>spring</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:15\" href=\"/Psalms.74.15\">ψ 74:15</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיַן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.25\">2 K 3:25</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיְנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 114:8\" href=\"/Psalms.114.8\">ψ 114:8</a> (Ges<sup>§ 90 n</sup>); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיָנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:15\" href=\"/Hosea.13.15\">Ho 13:15</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיָנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">Is 41:18</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:10\" href=\"/Psalms.104.10\">ψ 104:10</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיְנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:11\" href=\"/Genesis.7.11\">Gn 7:11</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיְנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.5\">1 K 18:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.19\">2 K 3:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעַיְנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 12:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.12.3\">Is 12:3</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיָנַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 87:7\" href=\"/Psalms.87.7\">ψ 87:7</a> (but v. infr.), <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְיְנֹתֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.16\">Pr 5:16</a>;—<em>spring</em>, cstr. before <span dir=\"rtl\">מַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.5\">1 K 18:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.19\">2 K 3:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:9\" href=\"/Joshua.15.9\">Jos 15:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:15\" href=\"/Joshua.18.15\">18:15</a> (both P), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 114:8\" href=\"/Psalms.114.8\">ψ 114:8</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.24\">Pr 8:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַ